@@ -0,0 +1,46 @@
+# MASTER7 v151 MegaH5 safety release
+
+Date: 2026-11-10 UTC
+
+## Scope
+
+This release hardens the legacy `megah5_myr` boundary without enabling member
+Play or provider money movement. Payment-provider work is unchanged.
+
+## Implemented
+
+- Strict gateway parsing for the MegaH5 catalogue, GameLogin, balance,
+  Deposit, Withdraw and CheckTransferStatus responses.
+- Bounded public catalogue projection with unique game codes and no unknown
+  supplier fields.
+- Strict game code, IPv4, language, boolean demo and HTTPS redirect checks.
+- Exact server-side launch-origin allowlist in the portal. Missing, malformed,
+  wildcard or duplicate origins fail closed before a wallet reservation or
+  supplier request.
